===
CPL
===

Version:

.. include:: src/cpl/VERSION

Overview
========

General Condor Pacific LTD's Host Utils.
include:

    #.  **errors** sub-package for errors and exceptions
    #.  **files** sub-package for read and write fies with data and metadata
    #.  **gui** sub-package for a gui
    #.  **log** sub-package for logging
    #.  **phystate** sub-package for physical states
    #.  **quaternions** sub-package for Quaternions
    #.  **reports** sub-package for create docx and pdf files after analysis

this repo is the root of the dependencies for all of Condor Pacific LTD's python repos

Installation
===========

for installing the package form Condor's local PyPI use:

.. code-block::

    pip install -i http://10.0.0.108:80/simple --trusted-host 10.0.0.108 cpl

installing from the PyPI is preferable

for installing the package from bitbucket use:

.. code-block::

    pip install git+https://bitbucket.org/Yosibuc/cpl.git

`bitbucket`_

.. _bitbucket: https://bitbucket.org/Yosibuc/cpl.git

for local installation after cloning the git repo use:

.. code-block::

    pip install .

-e flag can be add for edit mode installation

[tests,docs,release] are optional dependencies that can be add for developments tools

